  - headerText: Disentangling Objects
    bodyText: 'When two objects are entangled, the affected object will be marked
      with a yellow selector in Entanglement Mode.


      In order to break the
      entanglement, simply click on the object with the yellow selector.


      Note:
      Entangled objects will also have a pulsating blue glow.'
    illustrationMode: 2
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
