  - headerText: Multiple Entanglement
    bodyText: 'One object can entangle multiple others! To do this, click an object
      and click another one to entangle them.


      To entangle another object,
      simply click the original object again and click another one!


      Note:
      Breaking entanglement works the same way as with one object, just click the
      yellow highlighted objects.'
    illustrationMode: 2
    illustration: {fileID: 0}
